=== base ===
# Translation Services Agreement

This Agreement is made between Polyglot Bridge Ltd (the "Supplier") and Cairnbrook Medical Devices Ltd (the "Customer").

## 5. Turnaround
5.1 The Supplier shall return each translated document within 5 working days.
5.2 The Supplier shall use a qualified medical translator for every document.
=== amendment ===
# Variation

This Variation is made on 7 December 2027 between Polyglot Bridge Ltd (the "Supplier") and Cairnbrook Medical Devices Ltd (the "Customer").

1. In clause 5.1, the words "10 working days" are replaced by "3 working days".
